        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Bumaeng than mei le muang rui zailou meipu,",
            "Guangc Immanuel na guang datro,",
            "Numbang zing pui chaeng khou tat bam khou hei,",
            "Gan guang datro ting kao",
            "Ganphiu gaan gailiangmei pu rui.",
            "",
            "He! Kao ganphiew (2) gaimei,",
            "Kanloumei pu le Guangh dailiang mei pu nang e,",
            "Ryanra mei rui rih kum ma dai guang pusini,",
            "Ring mei Ravguangc khou ting saeng zaeng bam ni.",
            "",
            "2. Nchum pui kaikham chaeng mun lan lou pui kan khou,",
            "Kachaek namdai gaimei khou gut ni,",
            "Paapzaeng khou rui ryanra lou mei guai tei,",
            "Katikgunc daimei ram .",
            "Guang tang pukhou mun kum puang ni.",
            "",
            "3. Lauziuna daimei neikei datmak pui ram khou,",
            "Zianmei nun rui kan di ning dat lak,",
            "Lauziunah tikgun daimei thuanku ni,",
            "Ringhmei thingbang lim khou,",
            "Mphuanmei pheiban na bam ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
